 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "The Mona Lisa wasn't the most famous painting in the world,",
   "s": 0.18,
   "e": 2.632
  },
  {
   "text": "until somebody stole it.",
   "s": 2.943,
   "e": 4.031
  },
  {
   "text": "Paris,",
   "s": 4.617,
   "e": 5.01
  },
  {
   "text": "August 1911.",
   "s": 5.286,
   "e": 6.163
  },
  {
   "text": "On a Monday,",
   "s": 6.385,
   "e": 7.417
  },
  {
   "text": "when the Louvre is closed,",
   "s": 7.922,
   "e": 9.758
  },
  {
   "text": "a man in a white worker's smock walks calmly out of the museum.",
   "s": 10.052,
   "e": 12.928
  },
  {
   "text": "Under the smock is Leonardo da Vinci's portrait.",
   "s": 13.439,
   "e": 15.539
  },
  {
   "text": "His name is Vincenzo Peruggia.",
   "s": 16.13,
   "e": 17.651
  },
  {
   "text": "He had worked at the Louvre as a handyman,",
   "s": 18.015,
   "e": 19.604
  },
  {
   "text": "so the night before,",
   "s": 19.936,
   "e": 20.723
  },
  {
   "text": "he simply hid in a storage cupboard and waited.",
   "s": 20.998,
   "e": 23.009
  },
  {
   "text": "His plan was almost too simple.",
   "s": 23.63,
   "e": 25.057
  },
  {
   "text": "He dressed exactly like the staff,",
   "s": 25.442,
   "e": 26.859
  },
  {
   "text": "so nobody looked twice.",
   "s": 27.121,
   "e": 28.392
  },
  {
   "text": "When the guards noticed the empty wall,",
   "s": 28.998,
   "e": 30.358
  },
  {
   "text": "they assumed she was being photographed.",
   "s": 30.761,
   "e": 32.228
  },
  {
   "text": "It took more than a day before anyone raised the alarm.",
   "s": 32.51,
   "e": 34.657
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the world went crazy.",
   "s": 35.274,
   "e": 36.565
  },
  {
   "text": "Her face was printed in newspapers everywhere.",
   "s": 36.874,
   "e": 38.859
  },
  {
   "text": "The museum closed for a week.",
   "s": 39.145,
   "e": 40.448
  },
  {
   "text": "When it reopened,",
   "s": 40.755,
   "e": 41.415
  },
  {
   "text": "crowds queued for hours,",
   "s": 41.663,
   "e": 42.93
  },
  {
   "text": "just to stare at four empty hooks.",
   "s": 43.208,
   "e": 44.823
  },
  {
   "text": "The police questioned everyone.",
   "s": 45.396,
   "e": 46.724
  },
  {
   "text": "Even a young painter named Pablo Picasso was brought in for questioning.",
   "s": 47.041,
   "e": 49.862
  },
  {
   "text": "Meanwhile,",
   "s": 50.509,
   "e": 50.987
  },
  {
   "text": "the real thief kept her hidden in a trunk in his small Paris room,",
   "s": 51.325,
   "e": 53.887
  },
  {
   "text": "for two years.",
   "s": 54.243,
   "e": 54.893
  },
  {
   "text": "He was finally caught in Florence,",
   "s": 55.482,
   "e": 56.721
  },
  {
   "text": "trying to sell her.",
   "s": 56.957,
   "e": 57.567
  },
  {
   "text": "But by then, everybody knew her face.",
   "s": 58.17,
   "e": 59.755
  },
  {
   "text": "The thief didn't steal the Mona Lisa's fame.",
   "s": 60.317,
   "e": 62.068
  },
  {
   "text": "He created it.",
   "s": 62.4,
   "e": 63.105
  }
 ]
}